---
---

<section id="about">
  <div class="section">
    <p class="section-label" data-i18n="about.label">01 — SOBRE MÍ</p>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Photo column -->
      <div class="photo-col" data-reveal>
        <div class="photo-wrapper">
          <img
            src="/images/profile-700.webp"
            width="700"
            height="835"
            decoding="async"
            alt="Nicolas Rodriguez Forero"
            class="profile-img"
            loading="lazy"
            onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
          />
          <!-- Fallback initials placeholder -->
          <div class="photo-placeholder" style="display:none;">
            <span class="initials gradient-text">NR</span>
          </div>
          <div class="photo-border"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="photo-stats">
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-value gradient-text">2022</span>
            <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="about.stat.since">Inicio en programación</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-value gradient-text">6+</span>
            <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="about.stat.projects">Proyectos en producción</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <span class="stat-value gradient-text">B2</span>
            <span class="stat-label" data-i18n="about.stat.english">Inglés</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bio column -->
      <div class="bio-col">
        <h2
          class="about-heading"
          data-reveal
          data-i18n-html="about.heading"
        >
            Ingeniero en IA que<br /><span class="gradient-text">piensa en sistemas.</span>
          </span>
        </h2>

        <div class="bio-text">
          <p data-reveal data-i18n-html="about.bio1">
            Soy Nicolás, Ingeniero en Ciencias de la Computación e Inteligencia Artificial de la Universidad Sergio Arboleda, graduado <strong>Cum Laude</strong> en 2026 y seleccionado tres semestres seguidos en el Programa de Honores Rodrigo Noguera Laborde. Construyo sistemas de IA —RAG, agentes con LangGraph, embeddings y búsqueda híbrida— que llegan a producción.
          </p>

          <p data-reveal data-i18n-html="about.bio2">
            Hoy trabajo como <strong>Ingeniero de Proyectos en InConcert</strong>, donde lidero proyectos de contact center de punta a punta, y como <strong>Desarrollador Backend en Indetech Consulting</strong>, donde construyo el motor de matching de PriceIt (8 cadenas de retail, ≈128 mil ofertas) con FastAPI, Cosmos DB y búsqueda híbrida en Azure.
          </p>

          <p data-reveal data-i18n="about.bio3">
            Antes entregué 3 proyectos full stack para clientes en Tech Craft Solutions y, junto a Daniel Velasco, construí ATLAS —que presenté en Data Fest 2026— y OrbitEngine, un SaaS con hasta 7 empresas activas.
          </p>
        </div>

        <blockquote class="highlight-quote" data-reveal data-i18n-html="about.quote">
          <span class="quote-mark gradient-text">"</span>
          No solo escribo código — diseño soluciones que duran.
          <span class="quote-mark gradient-text">"</span>
        </blockquote>

        <div class="about-badges" data-reveal>
          <span class="badge" data-i18n="about.badge.university">Universidad Sergio Arboleda · Cum Laude</span>
          <span class="badge" data-i18n="about.badge.honors">Programa de Honores 2025-I · 2025-II · 2026-I</span>
          <span class="badge" data-i18n="about.badge.location">Bogotá, Colombia</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #about {
    border-top: 1px solid #1A2535;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 340px 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  /* Photo */
  .photo-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .photo-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .profile-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top;
    border-radius: 16px;
    display: block;
    filter: grayscale(10%) contrast(1.05);
    border: 1px solid #1A2535;
  }

  .photo-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--surface-highlight);
    border: 1px solid #1A2535;
    border-radius: 16px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .initials {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 5rem;
  }

  .photo-border {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 10px -10px -10px 10px;
    border: 1px solid #00FF8740;
    border-radius: 16px;
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .photo-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .stat {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--surface-highlight);
    border: 1px solid #1A2535;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .stat-value {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }
  .stat-label {
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #8899AA;
  }

  /* Bio */
  .bio-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .about-heading {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #E8EDF2;
  }

  .bio-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .bio-text p {
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.975rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #8899AA;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .bio-text strong {
    color: #E8EDF2;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .highlight-quote {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.8vw, 1.35rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #E8EDF2;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
    background: linear-gradient(#0D1520, #0D1520) padding-box,
                linear-gradient(135deg, #00FF87, #00CFFF) border-box;
    border-radius: 14px;
  }
  .quote-mark {
    font-size: 1.5em;
    line-height: 0;
    vertical-align: -0.3em;
  }

  .about-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .badge {
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #00FF87;
    background: #00FF8710;
    border: 1px solid #00FF8730;
    border-radius: 100px;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
    .photo-wrapper {
      max-width: 280px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .photo-stats {
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .stat { flex: 1; min-width: 130px; }
  }
</style>
